#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# unit_triangle

#% text
# `unit_triangle(x)` gives the triangle 1 - |x| for |x| < 1 and 0 otherwise.

#% text
# `unit_triangle(x, y, ...)` gives the product.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Symbolic arguments stay unevaluated.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
unit_triangle(1/2)
#% output
#= 1/2

#% cell
unit_triangle(-0.25)
#% output
#= 0.75

#% cell
unit_triangle(2)
#% output
#= 0

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `unit_box`, `ramp`
